# Lint vector - PPSE FCI whose directory entry (61) carries no ADF Name (4F)
# Synthetic negative-test vector; no cardholder data.
# 6F > 84 "2PAY.SYS.DDF01" + A5 > BF0C > 61 > 87 (priority), with no 4F to select an application.
# EMV Book 1 v4.4 12.3.4 -> WARNING fci-mandatory (plus INFO unknown-tag for BF0C and 61, which the
# dictionary does not name).
6F 1A 84 0E 32 50 41 59 2E 53 59 53 2E 44 44 46 30 31 A5 08 BF 0C 05 61 03 87 01 01
